// Vocal chops from deck A — needs a track with stems on deck A.
// Patch cuts two clips from it when you evaluate: a one-beat chop from
// the last vocal phrase and a one-bar drum loop from bar 16. The chop
// stutters on an Euclidean pattern, the loop keeps a groove alive even
// after deck A stops (that's the point: transitions).
// Plays through Patch's sampler; deck A itself isn't touched.
cycle 4
chop: sample("derived:deck-a:vocals:phrase-last:beats-1", "<1(3,8) 1(3,8,3)>").every(4, ply(2))
loop: sample("derived:deck-a:drums:bar-16", "1")
kick: s("bd*4")
scene("pulse")
visual.intensity("<1(3,8) 1(3,8,3)>")
